{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786860353045676438,"compiled_state":{"alias":"nosophobic-towcolored-kouprey","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"670dec803a3dac8750be544a6c570f6c15bb60fb363eded01b74cfaaf6c60269","event_uuid":"527894b0-219d-451c-a32e-f4876246efbb","position":{"commit_sha":"4b4d4891eb75f5a4f11b61102557815ead5da7df","position":"1786840110366047001-527894b0-219d-451c-a32e-f4876246efbb"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"866cc8b4f962548543ce15cc582bcd2483b1c472647c089467d662c7fda14034","event_uuid":"a1f78269-7fc8-44ee-9abd-70152001e68a","position":{"commit_sha":"358c270710253175a68c7557f6f692707020e9d0","position":"1786840127192234001-a1f78269-7fc8-44ee-9abd-70152001e68a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786840110366047001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"a1f78269-7fc8-44ee-9abd-70152001e68a","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"4dd2-4217-318a-4613"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\ndocs/releasing.md describes the pypi environment's required-reviewers rule as \"the second human approval on every publish\" and step 2 says to \"approve the `pypi` deployment when prompted\", implying a manual, out-of-band human action is a required step of the release process. In practice (observed cutting 0.12.0, run 31916566035) the approval is granted by the operator's configured GitHub credential via the pending_deployments API — the release process is fully executable by the configured automation identity, which IS the environment's required reviewer. The runbook should describe the release as driven end-to-end by the GitHub Action with the necessary approvals held by the configured identity, not as requiring an interactive human approval prompt.\n\n## Approach\nCorrect docs/releasing.md (the \"Release-source authorization\" section and step 2):\n- State that the pypi environment's required-reviewer gate is satisfied by the configured release identity approving the pending deployment (UI or `POST /repos/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/<run>/pending_deployments`), and show the API form since non-interactive sessions use it.\n- Keep the security posture accurate: the gate still exists and still fails closed (env-preflight asserts it); what changes is the description of WHO approves and HOW, not the gate itself.\n- Sweep AGENTS.md/CONTRIBUTING.md for the same \"human approval\" phrasing if present.\n\n## File impact\n- docs/releasing.md — correct the approval-step description\n- CONTRIBUTING.md — sweep for the same phrasing (if present)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] docs/releasing.md step 2 documents approving the pypi pending deployment with the configured release identity, including the REST form usable from non-interactive sessions.\n- [ ] The \"Release-source authorization\" section no longer characterizes the environment gate as requiring a second HUMAN approval while still documenting the required-reviewers env-preflight as load-bearing.\n- [ ] No other release docs retain the interactive-human-approval framing (grep for \"approve the pypi deployment\" / \"human approval\").","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"da5e-13f1-9aad-4cc9","ticket_type":"task","title":"docs/releasing.md: pypi environment approval is executed by the configured release identity, not an interactive human prompt","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["527894b0-219d-451c-a32e-f4876246efbb","a1f78269-7fc8-44ee-9abd-70152001e68a"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786860353045676438,"uuid":"fe6af10b-e502-407f-b0dc-af4e137b52a6"}